{title: Close to Thee}
{key: G}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 4/4}
{meta: author Fanny Crosby}
{meta: author Silas Vail}
{meta: year 1874}
{meta: died 1915}
{meta: died 1883}
{meta: source WorshipCommons, https://worshipcommons.org/songs/ObT5L_2ZxdN}
{copyright: Public domain}

Verse 1
[G]Thou my everlasting [C]portion, [G]more than friend or [D]life to me,
[G]all along my pilgrim [C]journey, [G]Savior, [D]let me walk with [G]thee.

Chorus
[G]Close to thee, [C]close to [G]thee, [G]close to thee, [D]close to thee:
[G]all along my pilgrim [C]journey, [G]Savior, [D]let me walk with [G]thee.
